{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1445862-dark-ages-abyss-mysticism-ritual","id":1445862,"title":"Dark Ages Abyss Mysticism ritual","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-25T13:03:53-07:00","id":1445862,"title":"Dark Ages Abyss Mysticism ritual","content":"Hey there,<br /> <br /> so I am playing an Abyss Mystic in a Dark Ages game and I have question about a ritual in Tome of Secrets; Summing the Blatherskites. It states that the roll for the ritual is an extended test of with a target of 10, 15, or 20 successes. However, it doesn't state the time each roll is supposed to represent. However, the rest of the description of the ritual seems to indicate that it can't just be a single turn.<br /> <br /> Anyone used this ritual? Or have a good idea as to the timing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T13:18:13-07:00","id":1445864,"title":"","content":"I would imagine that such a Ritual would be multiple turns of rolling, within a singular scene of course. After each roll, you or the ST would describe what goes on ICly in relation to the successes achieved until you finally hit the target mark; to where you described the Ritual being completed and the desired outcome happening (or no happening, depending on roll luck). For specific time-intervals itself, I'd just have the extended ongoings of the ritual as a whole be a downtime thing and/or behind-the-scenes progression; similar to how it goes on and is described on how Rituals work via M20.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}